    icon: "🚀",
    title: "Django中间件",
    content: `# Django中间件\n\n## 一、中间件概念\n\nDjango中间件是一个轻量级、底层的"插件"系统，可以全局介入Django的请求和响应处理过程。中间件本质上是一个类，它在请求到达视图前、视图处理后，对请求和响应进行处理。\n\n### 执行顺序\n\n中间件遵循"洋葱模型"执行：\n\n| 阶段 | 执行顺序 | 方法 |\n|------|---------|------|\n| 请求处理前 | 从上到下 | process_request |\n| 视图调用前 | 从上到下 | process_view |\n| 视图抛出异常 | 从下到上 | process_exception |\n| 响应返回后 | 从下到上 | process_response |\n\n\`\`\`python\n# settings.py 中间件配置\nMIDDLEWARE = [\n    'django.middleware.security.SecurityMiddleware',\n    'django.contrib.sessions.middleware.SessionMiddleware',\n    'django.middleware.common.CommonMiddleware',\n    'django.middleware.csrf.CsrfViewMiddleware',\n    'django.contrib.auth.middleware.AuthenticationMiddleware',\n]\n\`\`\`\n\n## 二、内置中间件解析\n\n| 中间件 | 功能说明 |\n|--------|---------|\n| SecurityMiddleware | 安全设置：HTTPS重定向、HSTS头、XSS保护 |\n| SessionMiddleware | 会话支持，启用request.session |\n| CommonMiddleware | URL自动加斜杠、Content-Length、ETag |\n| CsrfViewMiddleware | CSRF跨站请求伪造防护 |\n| AuthenticationMiddleware | 向request添加user属性 |\n| MessageMiddleware | 消息闪现支持 |\n| XFrameOptionsMiddleware | 防止点击劫持 |\n\n## 三、自定义中间件\n\n### 3.1 新风格中间件（Django 1.10+）\n\n\`\`\`python\nclass RequestTimingMiddleware:\n    def __init__(self, get_response):\n        self.get_response = get_response\n\n    def __call__(self, request):\n        # process_request 逻辑\n        import time\n        request.start_time = time.time()\n\n        response = self.get_response(request)\n\n        # process_response 逻辑\n        duration = time.time() - request.start_time\n        response['X-Request-Duration'] = str(duration)\n        return response\n\`\`\`\n\n### 3.2 MiddlewareMixin 旧风格\n\n\`\`\`python\nfrom django.utils.deprecation import MiddlewareMixin\n\nclass IPBlockMiddleware(MiddlewareMixin):\n    BLOCKED_IPS = {'192.168.1.100'}\n\n    def process_request(self, request):\n        ip = request.META.get('REMOTE_ADDR')\n        if ip in self.BLOCKED_IPS:\n            from django.http import HttpResponseForbidden\n            return HttpResponseForbidden('IP blocked')\n        return None\n\n    def process_response(self, request, response):\n        response['X-Server'] = 'Django'\n        return response\n\n\`\`\`\n\n### 3.3 process_view方法\n\n\`\`\`python\nclass ViewLoggingMiddleware(MiddlewareMixin):\n    def process_view(self, request, view_func, view_args, view_kwargs):\n        print(f'Calling view: {view_func.__name__}')\n        print(f'Args: {view_args}, Kwargs: {view_kwargs}')\n        return None\n\`\`\`\n\n### 3.4 process_exception方法\n\n\`\`\`python\nimport traceback\nimport logging\nlogger = logging.getLogger(__name__)\n\nclass ExceptionHandlingMiddleware(MiddlewareMixin):\n    def process_exception(self, request, exception):\n        logger.error(f'Exception at {request.path}: {str(exception)}')\n        logger.error(traceback.format_exc())\n        from django.http import JsonResponse\n        if request.headers.get('X-Requested-With') == 'XMLHttpRequest':\n            return JsonResponse({'error': str(exception)}, status=500)\n        return None\n\`\`\`\n\n## 四、自定义中间件实战\n\n### JWT认证中间件\n\n\`\`\`python\nimport jwt\nfrom django.conf import settings\nfrom django.http import JsonResponse\nfrom django.contrib.auth import get_user_model\nfrom django.contrib.auth.models import AnonymousUser\n\nUser = get_user_model()\n\nclass JWTAuthMiddleware:\n    def __init__(self, get_response):\n        self.get_response = get_response\n        self.exempt_paths = ['/api/login/', '/api/register/']\n\n    def __call__(self, request):\n        if any(request.path.startswith(p) for p in self.exempt_paths):\n            request.user = AnonymousUser()\n            return self.get_response(request)\n\n        auth_header = request.headers.get('Authorization', '')\n        if auth_header.startswith('Bearer '):\n            token = auth_header.split(' ')[1]\n            try:\n                payload = jwt.decode(token, settings.SECRET_KEY, algorithms=['HS256'])\n                user = User.objects.get(id=payload['user_id'], is_active=True)\n                request.user = user\n            except Exception:\n                request.user = AnonymousUser()\n        else:\n            request.user = AnonymousUser()\n\n        return self.get_response(request)\n\`\`\`\n\n## 五、最佳实践\n\n1. **中间件顺序很重要**：SessionMiddleware必须在AuthenticationMiddleware之前\n2. **性能优化**：process_request中尽早短路不需要处理的请求\n3. **避免数据库查询**：__init__中做初始化，不要每个请求都查DB\n4. **异常处理**：process_exception统一处理API异常\n5. **使用新风格**：新项目推荐使用__call__方式\n\n## 六、常见坑点\n\n\`\`\`python\n# 坑1：忘记调用get_response，请求到不了视图\nclass BadMiddleware:\n    def __init__(self, get_response):\n        self.get_response = get_response\n    def __call__(self, request):\n        return HttpResponse('Blocked')  # 错误！没调用get_response\n\n# 坑2：process_response必须返回response\nclass BadResponseMiddleware(MiddlewareMixin):\n    def process_response(self, request, response):\n        if response.status_code == 200:\n            return response\n        # 忘记return None，其他状态码返回None导致500\n\`\`\``
