    title: "Django认证系统",
    content: `# Django认证系统\n\n## 一、User模型\n\nDjango内置强大的认证系统，核心是User模型。\n\n| 字段 | 类型 | 说明 |\n|------|------|------|\n| username | CharField | 用户名，150字符，唯一 |\n| password | CharField | 哈希后的密码 |\n| email | EmailField | 邮箱 |\n| first_name | CharField | 名 |\n| last_name | CharField | 姓 |\n| is_active | BooleanField | 是否激活 |\n| is_staff | BooleanField | 是否可登录admin |\n| is_superuser | BooleanField | 是否超级用户 |\n| date_joined | DateTimeField | 注册时间 |\n| last_login | DateTimeField | 最后登录 |\n\n\`\`\`python\nfrom django.contrib.auth.models import User\n\n# 创建用户（密码自动哈希）\nuser = User.objects.create_user(\n    username='zhangsan',\n    email='zhangsan@example.com',\n    password='StrongPass123!'\n)\n\n# 创建超级用户\nadmin = User.objects.create_superuser(\n    username='admin',\n    email='admin@example.com',\n    password='AdminPass123!'\n)\n\n# 设置密码\nuser.set_password('NewPassword456!')\nuser.save()\n\n# 验证密码\nuser.check_password('NewPassword456!')  # True\n\`\`\`\n\n## 二、authenticate/login/logout\n\n\`\`\`python\nfrom django.contrib.auth import authenticate, login, logout\nfrom django.http import JsonResponse\nfrom django.views.decorators.csrf import csrf_exempt\n\n@csrf_exempt\ndef login_view(request):\n    if request.method == 'POST':\n        import json\n        data = json.loads(request.body)\n        username = data.get('username')\n        password = data.get('password')\n        user = authenticate(request, username=username, password=password)\n        if user is not None:\n            login(request, user)\n            return JsonResponse({\n                'success': True,\n                'user': {'id': user.id, 'username': user.username}\n            })\n        return JsonResponse({'success': False, 'error': '用户名或密码错误'}, status=400)\n\ndef logout_view(request):\n    logout(request)\n    return JsonResponse({'success': True})\n\`\`\`\n\n## 三、权限系统\n\n### Permission模型\n\n每个Model默认有三个权限：add、change、delete。\n\n\`\`\`python\nfrom django.contrib.auth.models import Permission, Group\nfrom django.contrib.contenttypes.models import ContentType\nfrom myapp.models import Article\n\n# 获取Content Type\ncontent_type = ContentType.objects.get_for_model(Article)\n\n# 创建自定义权限\npermission, created = Permission.objects.get_or_create(\n    codename='can_publish',\n    name='Can Publish Articles',\n    content_type=content_type,\n)\n\n# 给用户添加权限\nuser.user_permissions.add(permission)\n\n# 检查权限\nuser.has_perm('myapp.can_publish')  # True\n\n\`\`\`\n\n### Group用户组\n\n\`\`\`python\n# 创建组\neditors_group, _ = Group.objects.get_or_create(name='editors')\n\n# 给组添加权限\neditors_group.permissions.add(\n    Permission.objects.get(codename='add_article'),\n    Permission.objects.get(codename='change_article'),\n)\n\n# 用户加入组\nuser.groups.add(editors_group)\n\n# 组权限会被用户继承\nuser.has_perm('myapp.add_article')  # True\n\`\`\`\n\n## 四、视图权限控制\n\n\`\`\`python\nfrom django.contrib.auth.decorators import login_required, permission_required\nfrom django.contrib.auth.mixins import LoginRequiredMixin, PermissionRequiredMixin\nfrom django.views.generic import ListView\n\n# 函数视图：登录要求\n@login_required\ndef my_profile(request):\n    return render(request, 'profile.html', {'user': request.user})\n\n# 函数视图：权限要求\n@permission_required('myapp.add_article', raise_exception=True)\ndef create_article(request):\n    pass\n\n# 类视图\nclass ArticleListView(LoginRequiredMixin, PermissionRequiredMixin, ListView):\n    model = Article\n    permission_required = 'myapp.view_article'\n    raise_exception = True\n\`\`\`\n\n## 五、自定义用户模型\n\n### 扩展AbstractUser\n\n\`\`\`python\n# models.py\nfrom django.contrib.auth.models import AbstractUser\nfrom django.db import models\n\nclass CustomUser(AbstractUser):\n    phone = models.CharField(max_length=11, unique=True, blank=True, null=True)\n    avatar = models.ImageField(upload_to='avatars/', blank=True)\n    birthday = models.DateField(blank=True, null=True)\n\n    class Meta:\n        db_table = 'custom_user'\n\n\`\`\`\n\nsettings.py配置：\n\n\`\`\`python\nAUTH_USER_MODEL = 'myapp.CustomUser'\n\`\`\`\n\n### 完全自定义 AbstractBaseUser\n\n\`\`\`python\nfrom django.contrib.auth.models import AbstractBaseUser, BaseUserManager, PermissionsMixin\n\nclass CustomUserManager(BaseUserManager):\n    def create_user(self, email, password=None, **extra):\n        if not email:\n            raise ValueError('Email is required')\n        email = self.normalize_email(email)\n        user = self.model(email=email, **extra)\n        user.set_password(password)\n        user.save()\n        return user\n\n    def create_superuser(self, email, password=None, **extra):\n        extra.setdefault('is_staff', True)\n        extra.setdefault('is_superuser', True)\n        return self.create_user(email, password, **extra)\n\nclass CustomUser(AbstractBaseUser, PermissionsMixin):\n    email = models.EmailField(unique=True)\n    username = models.CharField(max_length=150, unique=True)\n    is_staff = models.BooleanField(default=False)\n    is_active = models.BooleanField(default=True)\n    date_joined = models.DateTimeField(auto_now_add=True)\n\n    objects = CustomUserManager()\n\n    USERNAME_FIELD = 'email'\n    REQUIRED_FIELDS = ['username']\n\`\`\`\n\n## 六、最佳实践\n\n1. **项目开始就配置自定义用户模型**：后续迁移很麻烦\n2. **使用create_user创建用户**：不要用create，密码不会哈希\n3. **外键引用settings.AUTH_USER_MODEL**：不要直接import User\n4. **密码验证器配置**：启用AUTH_PASSWORD_VALIDATORS\n5. **登录限流**：防止暴力破解\n\n## 七、常见坑点\n\n\`\`\`python\n# 坑1：create vs create_user\nuser = User.objects.create(username='test', password='123')  # 密码明文！\nuser.check_password('123')  # False\n\n# 坑2：外键引用错误\nfrom myapp.models import CustomUser  # 可能循环导入\nclass Article(models.Model):\n    author = models.ForeignKey(CustomUser, on_delete=models.CASCADE)\n\n# 正确写法\nfrom django.conf import settings\nclass Article(models.Model):\n    author = models.ForeignKey(settings.AUTH_USER_MODEL, on_delete=models.CASCADE)\n\n\`\`\``
