    icon: "🚀",
    title: "Django REST Framework",
    content: `# Django REST Framework\n\n## 一、DRF入门\n\nDjango REST Framework（DRF）是构建Web API的强大工具包。\n\n### 安装配置\n\n\`\`\`bash\npip install djangorestframework\npip install markdown django-filter\n\`\`\`\n\n\`\`\`python\nINSTALLED_APPS = [\n    'rest_framework',\n]\n\nREST_FRAMEWORK = {\n    'DEFAULT_PERMISSION_CLASSES': [\n        'rest_framework.permissions.IsAuthenticated',\n    ],\n    'DEFAULT_AUTHENTICATION_CLASSES': [\n        'rest_framework.authentication.SessionAuthentication',\n        'rest_framework.authentication.TokenAuthentication',\n    ],\n    'DEFAULT_PAGINATION_CLASS': 'rest_framework.pagination.PageNumberPagination',\n    'PAGE_SIZE': 20,\n}\n\`\`\`\n\n## 二、Serializer序列化器\n\nSerializer将模型实例转换为JSON，也负责反序列化验证。\n\n### 基础Serializer\n\n\`\`\`python\nfrom rest_framework import serializers\nfrom myapp.models import Article\n\nclass ArticleSerializer(serializers.Serializer):\n    id = serializers.IntegerField(read_only=True)\n    title = serializers.CharField(max_length=200)\n    content = serializers.CharField()\n    created_at = serializers.DateTimeField(read_only=True)\n    author = serializers.PrimaryKeyRelatedField(read_only=True)\n\n    def create(self, validated_data):\n        return Article.objects.create(**validated_data)\n\n    def update(self, instance, validated_data):\n        instance.title = validated_data.get('title', instance.title)\n        instance.content = validated_data.get('content', instance.content)\n        instance.save()\n        return instance\n\n    def validate_title(self, value):\n        if 'django' not in value.lower():\n            raise serializers.ValidationError('标题必须包含Django')\n        return value\n\`\`\`\n\n### ModelSerializer\n\n\`\`\`python\nclass ArticleModelSerializer(serializers.ModelSerializer):\n    author_name = serializers.CharField(source='author.username', read_only=True)\n\n    class Meta:\n        model = Article\n        fields = ['id', 'title', 'content', 'author', 'author_name', 'created_at']\n        read_only_fields = ['author', 'created_at']\n        extra_kwargs = {\n            'title': {'min_length': 5, 'max_length': 200},\n            'content': {'required': True},\n        }\n\n    def validate(self, data):\n        if data['title'] == data['content']:\n            raise serializers.ValidationError('标题和内容不能相同')\n        return data\n\`\`\`\n\n## 三、APIView与GenericAPIView\n\n\`\`\`python\nfrom rest_framework.views import APIView\nfrom rest_framework import generics\nfrom rest_framework.response import Response\nfrom rest_framework import status\n\n# APIView 基础类\nclass ArticleListAPIView(APIView):\n    def get(self, request):\n        articles = Article.objects.all()\n        serializer = ArticleModelSerializer(articles, many=True)\n        return Response(serializer.data)\n\n    def post(self, request):\n        serializer = ArticleModelSerializer(data=request.data)\n        if serializer.is_valid():\n            serializer.save(author=request.user)\n            return Response(serializer.data, status=status.HTTP_201_CREATED)\n        return Response(serializer.errors, status=status.HTTP_400_BAD_REQUEST)\n\n# GenericAPIView + Mixins\nclass ArticleDetailView(generics.RetrieveUpdateDestroyAPIView):\n    queryset = Article.objects.all()\n    serializer_class = ArticleModelSerializer\n    permission_classes = [IsAuthenticated]\n\n    def perform_update(self, serializer):\n        serializer.save(author=self.request.user)\n\n\`\`\`\n\n### 通用视图类\n\n| 类 | 功能 | HTTP方法 |\n|----|------|---------|\n| CreateAPIView | 创建 | POST |\n| ListAPIView | 列表 | GET |\n| RetrieveAPIView | 详情 | GET |\n| UpdateAPIView | 更新 | PUT/PATCH |\n| DestroyAPIView | 删除 | DELETE |\n| ListCreateAPIView | 列表+创建 | GET/POST |\n| RetrieveUpdateAPIView | 详情+更新 | GET/PUT/PATCH |\n| RetrieveDestroyAPIView | 详情+删除 | GET/DELETE |\n| RetrieveUpdateDestroyAPIView | 详情+更新+删除 | GET/PUT/PATCH/DELETE |\n\n## 四、ViewSet与Router\n\n\`\`\`python\nfrom rest_framework import viewsets\nfrom rest_framework.decorators import action\nfrom rest_framework.permissions import IsAuthenticatedOrReadOnly\n\nclass ArticleViewSet(viewsets.ModelViewSet):\n    queryset = Article.objects.all()\n    serializer_class = ArticleModelSerializer\n    permission_classes = [IsAuthenticatedOrReadOnly]\n\n    def perform_create(self, serializer):\n        serializer.save(author=self.request.user)\n\n    # 自定义action\n    @action(detail=True, methods=['post'])\n    def publish(self, request, pk=None):\n        article = self.get_object()\n        article.is_published = True\n        article.save()\n        return Response({'status': 'published'})\n\n    @action(detail=False, methods=['get'])\n    def my_articles(self, request):\n        articles = Article.objects.filter(author=request.user)\n        serializer = self.get_serializer(articles, many=True)\n        return Response(serializer.data)\n\n\`\`\`\n\n### Router注册\n\n\`\`\`python\nfrom rest_framework.routers import DefaultRouter\nfrom django.urls import path, include\n\nrouter = DefaultRouter()\nrouter.register(r'articles', ArticleViewSet)\n\nurlpatterns = [\n    path('api/', include(router.urls)),\n]\n\n# 自动生成路由：\n# GET/POST /api/articles/  列表/创建\n# GET/PUT/PATCH/DELETE /api/articles/{id}/  详情/更新/删除\n# POST /api/articles/{id}/publish/  自定义action\n# GET /api/articles/my_articles/  自定义列表action\n\`\`\`\n\n## 五、最佳实践\n\n1. **Serializer分层**：ListSerializer和DetailSerializer分开\n2. **业务逻辑写在Serializer或ViewSet的perform_xxx**\n3. **使用ViewSet+Router**：简化URL配置\n4. **善用select_related/prefetch_related**：解决N+1问题\n5. **正确配置permission_classes**：最小权限原则\n\n## 六、常见坑点\n\n\`\`\`python\n# 坑1：Serialzer中嵌套对象序列化\nclass ArticleSerializer(serializers.ModelSerializer):\n    author = UserSerializer()  # 嵌套序列化，POST时需要传完整对象\n    # 正确：write和read分开\n    author = UserSerializer(read_only=True)\n    author_id = serializers.PrimaryKeyRelatedField(\n        queryset=User.objects.all(), write_only=True, source='author'\n    )\n\n# 坑2：N+1查询问题\nclass ArticleViewSet(viewsets.ModelViewSet):\n    queryset = Article.objects.all()  # 可能N+1\n    # 优化\n    queryset = Article.objects.select_related('author').all()\n\n\`\`\``
